---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  eyebrow="Akxar Labs"
  description="An early-stage research lab studying how AI agents behave in open-ended, multi-agent settings."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Standard evaluations tend to examine short trajectories of a single model. Open-ended
      environments with many agents can reveal more: long-horizon coordination, mutual influence,
      and strategies no one anticipated.
    </p>
    <p>
      Akxar Labs designs scenarios that probe specific behavioral dispositions, builds monitoring
      and oversight tooling for multi-agent systems, and aims to make the underlying environments
      available as a shared resource for safety research.
    </p>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      We are at an early stage and welcome conversations with researchers and collaborators. Reach
      us at <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
